   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DIVERGES. Desktop = 3D scroll-rotate.\nMobile: static 4K render OR muted\nautoplay poster. NO useFrame /\nscroll rotation (perf + touch).\nHeadline 'Something New Under\nThe Sun' below product. 1 CTA.\nscroll cue.",
